            {
              "id": "AZ-STORAGE-001",
              "name": "StorageAccountAllowsPublicBlobContainers",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Storage account allows public blob containers"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "allow_nested_items_to_be_public = true lets any container in the account be switched to anonymous public read access."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "allow_nested_items_to_be_public = true lets any container in the account be switched to anonymous public read access.\n\nRemediation:\nallow_nested_items_to_be_public = false",
                "markdown": "allow_nested_items_to_be_public = true lets any container in the account be switched to anonymous public read access.\n\n**Remediation**\n\n```hcl\nallow_nested_items_to_be_public = false\n```"
