            {
              "id": "AZ-STORAGE-002",
              "name": "StorageAccountAcceptsPlainHttp",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Storage account accepts plain HTTP"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "With HTTPS-only disabled, storage requests (including SAS tokens in the URL) can travel unencrypted."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "With HTTPS-only disabled, storage requests (including SAS tokens in the URL) can travel unencrypted.\n\nRemediation:\nhttps_traffic_only_enabled = true  # enable_https_traffic_only on azurerm < 4.0",
                "markdown": "With HTTPS-only disabled, storage requests (including SAS tokens in the URL) can travel unencrypted.\n\n**Remediation**\n\n```hcl\nhttps_traffic_only_enabled = true  # enable_https_traffic_only on azurerm < 4.0\n```"
              },
